@*
===========================================================
ORANGE TENDER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
PAGE: Supplier Registration Review

DEVELOPER OWNER: Rjoub
MODULE: Administration
TRELLO TASK: Supplier Administration
TRELLO URL: https://trello.com/c/zvMwn4LD

PURPOSE:
Review a pending supplier registration and its legal
documents, then approve, reject or suspend it.

BUSINESS ACCESS:
Admin

ROUTE: /Admin/Suppliers/Review/{id?}

FUTURE IMPLEMENTATION:
- Load the supplier with its Documents (SupplierId).
- POST Approve / Reject / Suspend: set Status, ReviewNotes,
  ReviewedByUserId, ReviewedAt (UTC).
- Verify documents: Documents.VerificationStatus,
  VerifiedByUserId, VerifiedAt.
- Notify the supplier account(s) and write AuditLogs.

DEPENDENCIES:
Suppliers, Documents, AspNetUsers (SupplierId),
Notifications, AuditLogs.

STATUS:
UI SCAFFOLD ONLY — BUSINESS LOGIC NOT IMPLEMENTED.

IMPORTANT:
Only Approved, active suppliers may be invited or submit
offers.
===========================================================
*@
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Supplier Registration Review";
    ViewData["WorkspaceSection"] = "Suppliers";
    ViewData["Description"] = "Check a supplier’s registration and legal documents, then approve or reject it.";
}
<partial name="_PageHeader" />
<partial name="_ScaffoldNotice" />

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel">
    <h2>Company</h2>
    <dl class="pg-dl">
        <div><dt>Company name</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Registration number</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Tax number</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Email</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Phone</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Address</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Registered at</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Current status</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
    </dl>
</section>

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel" aria-labelledby="tbl-legal-documents">
    <div class="pg-panel-head"><h2 id="tbl-legal-documents">Legal documents</h2></div>
    <div class="pg-table-wrap">
        <table class="pg-table">
            <thead><tr><th scope="col">Document</th><th scope="col">Type</th><th scope="col">Uploaded</th><th scope="col">Expires</th><th scope="col">Verification</th><th scope="col">Actions</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody><tr><td colspan="6"><partial name="_EmptyState" model='"No documents uploaded by this supplier."' /></td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</section>

<div class="pg-grid">
<partial name="_ConfirmAction" model='new ConfirmActionModel("Approve supplier", "Approve this company so it can be invited to tenders.", "Sets Supplier.Status to Approved and records you as the reviewer.", false, false)' />
<partial name="_ConfirmAction" model='new ConfirmActionModel("Reject or suspend supplier", "Reject the registration or suspend an approved supplier.", "Sets the status to Rejected or Suspended with your reason. The company can no longer be invited.", true, true)' />
</div>
